    {
      "id": "b0098",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "e5751b87c2b709b6",
      "translationZh": "FSDP 和 DeepSpeed 如何管理权重预取？",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0099",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "4aebc0d3f0b0d733",
      "translationZh": "DeepSpeed 中与 FSDP 包装等效的机制是什么？",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0100",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "457a0e632906d5a0",
      "translationZh": "我们考虑了在 🤗 Accelerate 中配置这些框架的多种方式，",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0101",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "c7e90914a1f53166",
      "translationZh": "在执行 accelerate launch 时通过命令行配置",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0102",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "7c5bce12d0eadaee",
      "translationZh": "通过 🤗 Accelerate 为 (DeepSpeed)[https://huggingface.co/docs/accelerate/main/en/package_reference/deepspeed] 和 (FSDP)[https://huggingface.co/docs/accelerate/main/en/package_reference/fsdp] 提供的各种 Plugin 类进行配置",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0103",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "62b6c06979636131",
      "translationZh": "🤗 Accelerate 让 FSDP 和 DeepSpeed 之间的切换变得轻而易举，大部分工作只需修改 Accelerate 配置文件即可完成（相关操作说明请参阅新的概念指南）。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0104",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c49d94551b74752f",
      "translationZh": "除了配置变更之外，还需要考虑检查点处理方式的差异等其他事项（指南中也对此进行了说明）。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0105",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "224e6cdd4e098072",
      "translationZh": "本博客中的所有实验都可以使用最初的 🤗 Accelerate issue 中的代码来复现。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0106",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "7a53ba5ca93b04da",
      "translationZh": "我们计划在后续工作中开展大规模吞吐量比较，并探索在保持模型质量的同时，更好地利用这些 GPU 执行调优和对齐任务的技术。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0107",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "c9015d53b9084645",
      "translationZh": "致谢",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0108",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "1c5a951bac5fe680",
      "translationZh": "这项工作由多个组织的多个团队共同协作完成。它始于 IBM Research，具体而言，Aldo Pareja 发现了该问题，Fabian Lim 找出了精度差异并修复了该问题。Zach Mueller 和 Stas Bekman 在提供反馈以及为 accelerate 提供修复方面表现出色。Meta 的 PyTorch 团队成员 Less Wright 在解答 FSDP 参数相关问题时给予了很大帮助。最后，我们还要感谢 DeepSpeed 团队为本博客提供反馈。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    }
  ],
  "wordWise": [
